      },
      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The Shepherds are a cult known as the Shepherd\u2019s Flock, and they serve the power/entity Maelthor.\n\nThe \u201cShepherds\u201d refers to the **Shepherd\u2019s Flock**, a cult-like group currently active in the city (notably staging a protest at the gates). They recruit vulnerable or transformed individuals and frame their actions as necessary sacrifices for a greater cause.\n\n- **Allegiance:**  \n  - OBSERVED: They are explicitly **followers of Maelthor**.  \n  - OBSERVED: They are aligned with **Maelthor\u2019s influence and emergence**, and believe their actions help cleanse the world.\n\n- **Beliefs and Purpose:**  \n  - CANON: They see their actions as purifying the world of those resisting Maelthor.  \n  - CANON: They aim at **ensuring human supremacy** and justifying extreme acts as necessary.  \n  - OBSERVED: They actively recruit and indoctrinate others, revealing \u201ctruth\u201d during initiation.\n\n- **Public Face vs Reality:**  \n  - OBSERVED: Publicly, they present violence as defense against non-human threats.  \n  - OBSERVED: Internally, they operate as a coordinated cult tied to a larger, spreading influence.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Faction: Followers of Maelthor (OBSERVED)\n- Role: Cultists staging protests and recruiting (CANON/OBSERVED)\n- Goals: \u201cCleansing\u201d the world, human supremacy, expanding Maelthor\u2019s influence (CANON)\n- Activity: Active recruitment and agitation within the city (OBSERVED)",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_the_city_council_2",
      "question": "Who speaks for the wizards on the council, and what's his angle on the cult?",
      "strict_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "semantic_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "must_hits": [
