      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: Merril handles food/agriculture, Torrin represents the guilds/crafts, and Rurik oversees infrastructure and the city\u2019s structural integrity.\n\nMerril Tealeaf \u2014 Council role: Representative of Agriculture and Food Production (CANON/OBSERVED). She is the Leader of the Agricultural Union and focuses on food supply and public well-being.\n\nTorrin Flamescale \u2014 Council role: Representative of the Guilds / Craft Guilds (OBSERVED/CANON). As Master Smith, he speaks for artisans and industry.\n\nRurik Stonehammer \u2014 Council role: Representative of Infrastructure (CANON). As Chief Architect, he is responsible for the city\u2019s structural integrity and defenses.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Governance: Council includes domain-specific representatives (agriculture, guilds, infrastructure) (OBSERVED via roles)\n- Merril Tealeaf: Leader of Agricultural Union; food supply focus\n- Torrin Flamescale: Master Smith; guild representative\n- Rurik Stonehammer: Chief Architect; infrastructure oversight",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
